  "For two disjoint chunks of $e=m^k$ radix-$q$ digits each and a row field divisible by $W^k$, the interchange costs $O(Ve^\\tau)$, because the normalized cost satisfies $F_0=O(1)$ and $F_k\\le(s/W)F_{k-1}+O(1)$.",
